# Authors

Everyone who has contributed to revela, in the order they first contributed.
Added when a first contribution is merged; ask if yours is missing.

Contributors keep the copyright in their own work. The CLA (see CLA.md) is a
licence grant, not an assignment, so this file is a record of authorship rather
than a list of people who signed something away.

Serge Rabyking          <s.rabykin@gmail.com>    maintainer, original author
